{"id":"5164bda26b0e7924","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md","title":"Kullback-Leibler Divergence","display":"df-kullback-leibler — Kullback-Leibler Divergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kullback-leibler","aliases":["58-df-kullback-leibler"],"display":"df-kullback-leibler — Kullback-Leibler Divergence","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","[[58-df-density-function]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kullback-leibler"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kullback-leibler</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kullback-leibler — Kullback-Leibler Divergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4fc4686aaece886\" href=\"?note=d4fc4686aaece886\" title=\"58-df-density-function\">58-df-density-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md\">../batch19/58-df-exponential.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\\)</span> 使用所列依赖中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md\">../batch19/58-df-exponential.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists!u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists!u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\\iota u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t)\n\\qquad(t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\\iota u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t)\n\\qquad(t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;t=0,\\\\\nt\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)-t+1,&amp;t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad(t\\in[0,\\infty)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;t=0,\\\\\nt\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)-t+1,&amp;t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad(t\\in[0,\\infty)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kullback\\text{-}leibler}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land P(X)=Q(X)=1\\land d\\in[0,\\infty]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n(d,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(h(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\Bigl(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\land d=\\infty\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kullback\\text{-}leibler}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land P(X)=Q(X)=1\\land d\\in[0,\\infty]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n(d,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(h(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\Bigl(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)&gt;0)\\Bigr)\\land d=\\infty\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在概率归一化下，非负核 t log(t)−t+1 的 Q 积分与原 KL 值相同；零点值直接定义，不需要计算 log(0)。</li>\n<li>绝对连续概率测度具有处处有限的密度版本；在零测集上选取有限值不改变所定义的散度。</li>\n<li>保留非绝对连续时取正无穷的原条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-density-function","status":"resolved","id":"d4fc4686aaece886","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-density-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]；$\\exp$ 使用 [[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-exponential.md","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]；$\\exp$ 使用 [[../batch19/58-df-exponential.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists!u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\\iota u\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\exp(u)=t)\n\\qquad(t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&t=0,\\\\\nt\\operatorname{RealLog}_{58}(t)-t+1,&t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad(t\\in[0,\\infty)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kullback\\text{-}leibler}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land P(X)=Q(X)=1\\land d\\in[0,\\infty]\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n(d,\\{\\langle x,\\operatorname{KLKernel}_{58}(h(x))\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\Bigl(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)>0)\\Bigr)\\land d=\\infty\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2213,"backlinks":[{"id":"43b99c61f80582d8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-747","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md|58-df-kullback-leibler]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","7f96c502a4a99a46","d4fc4686aaece886","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","689fa138a0ce2d6c"]}